      ⍝ Bugs42 #29: the fill of a reduction whose operand is implemented by a




      ⍝ macro (e.g. (+⍤0)/) folds the operand's fill along the axis




      B←2 3⍴0 ◊ E←0⍴⊂B




      (⍴(+⍤0)/B) (⍴↑((+⍤0)/)¨E)
 2  2 



      (⍴(+⍤0)⌿B) (⍴↑((+⍤0)⌿)¨E)
 3  3 



      (⍴(×⍤0)/[1]B) (⍴↑((×⍤0)/[1])¨E)
 3  3 



      (⍴(+⍤1)/B) (⍴↑((+⍤1)/)¨E)
 2  2 



      Z←((,⍤1)/)¨E ◊ 2 ⎕TF 'Z'
Z←0⍴(⊂2⍴(0 0 0) (0 0 0))



      Z←(,⍤1)/B ◊ 2 ⎕TF 'Z'
Z←2⍴(0 0 0) (0 0 0)



      Z←((+⍤0)/)¨E ◊ 2 ⎕TF 'Z'
Z←0⍴(⊂2⍴0 0)



      Z←(+/)¨E ◊ 2 ⎕TF 'Z'
Z←0⍴(⊂2⍴0 0)



      Z←⍬∘.((+⍤0)/)E ◊ 2 ⎕TF 'Z'
Z←0 0⍴(⊂2 3⍴0 0 0 0 0 0)



      Z←((~⍤2 1)/)¨0⍴⊂(1 2)(3 4 5) ◊ 2 ⎕TF 'Z'
Z←0⍴(⊂⊂0⍴0)



      Z←(~⍤2 1)/(0 0)(0 0 0) ◊ 2 ⎕TF 'Z'
Z←⊂0⍴0



      )ERASE B E Z




      ⍝ Bugs42 #35: the )MORE information of a failed ⎕FX belongs to no other




      ⍝ error later in the statement




      ⎕FX 'Z←H B' 'Z←1÷0'
H



      H ⎕FX 'Z←G' 'Z←⍳¯1;2'
DOMAIN ERROR
H[1]  Z←1÷0
        ^^

      )MORE
NO )MORE ERROR INFO



      )SIC




      'a'+⎕FX 'Z←G' 'Z←⍳¯1;2'
DOMAIN ERROR
      'a'+⎕FX 'Z←G' 'Z←⍳¯1;2'
      ^  ^

      )MORE
NO )MORE ERROR INFO



      ⎕ES ⎕FX 'Z←G' 'Z←⍳¯1;2'
LENGTH ERROR
      ⎕ES ⎕FX 'Z←G' 'Z←⍳¯1;2'
      ^

      )MORE
NO )MORE ERROR INFO



      ⎕FX 'Z←G' 'Z←⍳¯1;2'
2



      )MORE
Error in function body in function line [1] of:
[0] Z←G
[1] Z←⍳¯1;2

      )SIC




      )ERASE H




      ⍝ Bugs42 #38: ⎕TRACE on a line with diamonds traces every statement




      ∇Z←F B
      A←10 ◊ C←20 ◊ D←30
      →(B>5)/L ◊ Z←'not branched'
      →0
      L: Z←'branched' ◊ →0
      ∇




      1 2 3 4 ⎕TRACE 'F'




      F 7
F[1] 10
F[1] 20
F[1] 30
F[2] ↦4
F[4] branched
F[4] ↦0
branched


      F 3
F[1] 10
F[1] 20
F[1] 30
F[2] not branched
F[3] ↦0
not branched


      )ERASE F A C D




      ⍝ Bugs41 #56 residue: in a script, a new header for a suspended function is




      ⍝ refused at once, and the following lines are not read as its body




      ∇Z←F56 B
      Z←B÷0
      ∇




      F56 1
DOMAIN ERROR
F56[1]  Z←B÷0
          ^^

      ∇Z←F56 B
DEFN ERROR+
      ∇Z←F56 B
             ^
      2+2
4







      )SIS
F56[1]  Z←B÷0
          ^^
*  F56 1
   ^




      ⎕ET
5 4







      )SIC
      )ERASE F56
